  "reasoning": "The defendant broke into the victim's house and stole identity documents, a household register, bank cards, a deposit book, a medical payment booklet, and cash. He also arranged for an accomplice to withdraw money from an ATM using the stolen bank cards, resulting in further theft of cash. All these acts constitute theft of property (including cash obtained via the stolen cards). No elements of fraud, illegal possession of drugs, or other offenses are present. Therefore the appropriate charge is theft.",
